{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"0fd01139d1173aab3c4eae9aadc1f8604860ccbde5e4b3d2c68eec56323410c3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["悔改带来祝福"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你被自己的罪恶绊倒了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"归向你的上帝耶和华吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要归向耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向祂忏悔说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“求你赦免我们一切的罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"施恩悦纳我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好叫我们以赞美为祭献给你！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚述不能救我们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们不再依靠战马，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不再称自己所造的神像为我们的上帝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为孤儿在你那里才能得到怜悯。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我要医治他们的叛道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心甘情愿地爱他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我的怒气已经转离他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要像甘露一样滋润以色列，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他绽放如百合花，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"扎根如黎巴嫩的香柏树。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要长出嫩枝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要像橄榄树一样荣美，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如黎巴嫩的香柏树一般芳香。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要归回，住在我的荫下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他要茂盛如五谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"荣美如葡萄树，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"声名远扬如黎巴嫩的美酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"“以法莲啊，我与偶像有何关系？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我应允你的祷告，看顾你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我像一棵青翠的松树，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的果实都来自于我。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"让那些智者明白这一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让那些明哲了解这一切。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华的道是正道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"义人要行走在上面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"罪人却在上面跌倒。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOL/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}